# ── Database ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# When DATABASE_URL is set, tablekeeper talks to a real Postgres (CI service,
# Neon/Supabase in production). When unset, it boots an embedded PGlite
# (real Postgres 17 compiled to WASM) — zero infrastructure, same SQL, same
# invariant constraint. See docs/BUILD_PLAN.md §2.3.
#
# Example (production / CI):
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@host:5432/tablekeeper

# Optional: persist the embedded PGlite database to disk for local dev.
# Unset = in-memory (fresh + re-seed on every start).
# TK_DATA_DIR=./.tkdata
